      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEEKEND SCOTCH (6) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.98) at this track behind BEDAZZLED JEWEL in a Mix 3/4. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Sure to be about the mark. BEDAZZLED JEWEL (1) recorded three placings in a row before an overdue win last time, scoring by 5 lengths (17.65) at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Deserves serious consideration again. ROB YOU BLIND (7) had been racing well with a Free For All win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at The Gardens. Has good speed and can quickly clear the pack out wide. Expected to do much better this time. SHE'S SILKY (5) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish here at this distance.",
